OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency heating oil fund
OL,4,Aextended into winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fund set up to help lower income
OL,7,Fhouseholds that rely on heating oil and
OL,8,FLPG to warm their homes has been
OL,9,Fextended into winter.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Emergency Heating Oil
OL,12,FScheme was introduced for an initial
OL,13,Fsix months on 1 April after conflict in
OL,14,Fthe Middle East drove up prices.
OL,16,FAbout 142,000 Scottish households use
OL,17,Fheating oil and average costs soared to
OL,18,F153.74 pence per litre in March and,
OL,19,Fafter dropping over the summer, prices
OL,20,Fhave risen to almost 121 pence per
OL,21,Flitre. About 27,000 households use LPG.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
